@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam ArrowColor #087C61
skinparam ClassBorderColor #087C61
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #EAF7ED
skinparam ActorBorderColor #192D3D
skinparam UsecaseBackgroundColor #EAF7ED
skinparam UsecaseBorderColor #087C61
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #EAF7ED
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #087C61
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF7ED
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #087C61
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF6DF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #C5AB62
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam dpi 160
actor "Administrator" as Admin
participant "SystemAdminReportView" as View
participant "Role mixin" as Role
participant "admin_reports" as Builder
database "Existing domain records" as DB
Admin -> View : GET page / PDF / CSV with dates
View -> Role : Check authenticated admin or superuser
alt Anonymous or unauthorised
 Role --> Admin : Login redirect or HTTP 403
else Allowed
 View -> Builder : Validate inclusive date range
 alt Invalid date range
  Builder --> Admin : HTTP 400 with form errors
 else Valid
  View -> Builder : build_admin_report(start, end)
  Builder -> DB : Current account/system totals\nand period activity counts
  DB --> Builder : Retained records
  Builder --> View : Shared report values
  alt Page
   View --> Admin : HTML with print action
  else PDF or CSV
   View -> Builder : Format requested download
   Builder --> Admin : System administration report
  end
 end
end
note over Builder, DB
Reads AccountEvent (sign-ins, failed logins, role and status changes)
as well as existing domain records. Active means enabled, not online.
Events exist only from installation. Network addresses are shown
on screen only, never in PDF or CSV. See account-security-sequence.
end note
@enduml
